I'm Kim Mills. Our guest today is Dr. Roland Griffiths. He is Director of the Center for Psychedelic and Consciousness Research and a professor of psychiatry and behavioral sciences at Johns Hopkins University in Baltimore. The Center's Research Group was the first to obtain regulatory approval in the United States to reinitiate research with psychedelics in healthy volunteers. Their 2006 publication on the safety and enduring positive effects of a single dose of psilocybin is widely considered the landmark study that sparked a renewal of psychedelic research worldwide.
我是金·米尔斯（Kim Mills）。我们今天的嘉宾是罗兰·格里菲斯（Roland Griffiths）博士。他是巴尔的摩约翰霍普金斯大学迷幻药与意识研究中心主任，也是精神病学和行为科学教授。该中心的研究小组是美国第一个获得监管部门批准，在健康志愿者身上重启迷幻药研究的机构。他们2006年发表的关于单剂量裸盖菇素的安全性和持久积极影响的论文，被广泛认为是引发全球迷幻药研究复兴的里程碑式研究。

